### Registracija
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "ana@primer.com",
  "password": "tajna123",
  "displayName": "Ana",
  "identityStatement": "Želim da postanem osoba koja čita svaki dan"
}

### Prijava (sačuvaj token i refreshToken iz odgovora)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "ana@primer.com",
  "password": "tajna123"
}

### Google login (idToken dobijas od Google Sign-In SDK-a na Androidu)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/google
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "idToken": "<GOOGLE_ID_TOKEN>"
}

### Osvežavanje tokena (zameni <REFRESH_TOKEN>; stari se opoziva - koristi novi iz odgovora)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "<REFRESH_TOKEN>"
}

### Odjava (opoziva samo ovu sesiju)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/logout
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "<REFRESH_TOKEN>"
}

### Kreiranje navike (zameni <TOKEN>)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/habits
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer <TOKEN>

{
  "name": "Čitanje",
  "category": "Učenje",
  "type": "BUILD",
  "frequencyType": "DAILY",
  "targetCount": 1,
  "reminderTime": "20:00",
  "cueText": "Nakon večere"
}

### Kreiranje navike sa kolicinskim pracenjem (QUANTITY)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/habits
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer <TOKEN>

{
  "name": "Voda",
  "category": "Zdravlje",
  "type": "BUILD",
  "frequencyType": "DAILY",
  "targetCount": 2000,
  "trackingType": "QUANTITY",
  "unit": "ml",
  "incrementAmount": 250
}

### Sve navike
GET http://localhost:8080/api/habits
Authorization: Bearer <TOKEN>

### Moj profil
GET http://localhost:8080/api/users/me
Authorization: Bearer <TOKEN>

### Izmena profila (npr. Onboarding)
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/users/me
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer <TOKEN>

{
  "displayName": "Ana",
  "identityStatement": "Želim da postanem osoba koja čita svaki dan"
}

### Beleženje izvršenja
POST http://localhost:8080/api/entries
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer <TOKEN>

{
  "habitId": "<HABIT_ID>",
  "date": "2026-07-24",
  "status": "DONE",
  "value": 1
}

### Sinhronizacija
POST http://localhost:8080/api/sync
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer <TOKEN>

{
  "since": 0,
  "habits": [],
  "entries": []
}

### Aktivne preporuke
GET http://localhost:8080/api/recommendations
Authorization: Bearer <TOKEN>

### Odbacivanje preporuke (zameni <RECOMMENDATION_ID>)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/recommendations/<RECOMMENDATION_ID>/dismiss
Authorization: Bearer <TOKEN>

### Otključana dostignuća
GET http://localhost:8080/api/achievements
Authorization: Bearer <TOKEN>

### Prijava otključavanja dostignuća (idempotentno po tipu - ponovni poziv sa istim tipom vraća postojeći zapis umesto da pravi duplikat)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/achievements
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer <TOKEN>

{
  "type": "STREAK_7",
  "unlockedAt": 1735689600000
}

### AI nedeljni uvid (opciono - ako ANTHROPIC_API_KEY nije podešen, vraća 502; Android strana u tom slučaju tiho koristi sopstveni fallback tekst)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/ai/weekly-insight
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer <TOKEN>

{
  "thisWeekPct": 82,
  "lastWeekPct": 70,
  "habits": [
    { "habitName": "Trčanje", "category": "Zdravlje", "thisWeekPct": 90, "currentStreak": 5 },
    { "habitName": "Čitanje", "category": "Učenje", "thisWeekPct": 60, "currentStreak": 0 }
  ]
}
